    {
      "id": "section:1/block:56/seg:0",
      "source": "Now I take a look again at _volume II_.",
      "source_hash": 11359119844141631434,
      "context_hash": 2028302533946764185,
      "translation": "이제 *volume II*를 다시 살펴봅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T13:39:37.763138Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:56/seg:1",
      "source": "Most of what we want to learn is in the description of `msr`, the machine status register.",
      "source_hash": 3254341600583748329,
      "context_hash": 302673227687206071,
      "translation": "우리가 알고 싶은 내용 대부분은 머신 상태 레지스터인 `msr`의 설명에 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T13:39:37.763138Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:56/seg:2",
      "source": "In step 1, we have a simple configuration, with only machine mode.",
      "source_hash": 11930487930357453482,
      "context_hash": 11929722976186643238,
      "translation": "1단계에서는 머신 모드만 있는 단순한 구성을 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T13:39:37.763138Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:56/seg:3",
      "source": "We make it even simpler, with no interruptions, and only exceptions.",
      "source_hash": 2586347760653227854,
      "context_hash": 5972068209848095835,
      "translation": "여기서 더 단순하게 만들어, 인터럽트 없이 예외만 다룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T13:39:37.763138Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:56/seg:4",
      "source": "Then we only need the following CSRs:",
      "source_hash": 12676911826552716101,
      "context_hash": 4706656403855876852,
      "translation": "그러면 다음 CSR만 있으면 됩니다:",
